        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Collecting "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "data",
            "ref": "v-data"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from undersea ice is important to some scientific research. But it’s always "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to get this information. Recently, an international team "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to some special “researchers” for help. These researchers didn’t need "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "beakers",
            "zh": "烧杯"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or lab coats. They were some seals!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "First, scientists "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " glued "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sensors",
            "zh": "传感器"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the seals’ heads. These sensors could "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the seals’ "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "behaviour",
            "ref": "v-behaviour"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and location. They could also "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the water temperature and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "amount",
            "ref": "v-amount"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of salt in the water. Once these seals got "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", they quickly swam away. They then dived up to about two kilometres under the sea ice. During this time, the sensors’ data was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the scientists."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“The seals can go where boats can’t,” said one of the scientists. “So this data is very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".” With the help of these seals, scientists were able to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more about how "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "climate change",
            "ref": "v-climate-change"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the animals in the oceans. We would like to give these seals an A+ in science class!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
